    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-2.2.07-16",
      "block_type": "worked_application",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "An improvement package works best when its components fit together. Better seed may fail without water; irrigation may underperform without nutrients; fertiliser may be lost during erosion; pest control may not compensate for late planting. A farm's output responds to the combined constraints. This is why an explanation should identify the limiting problem and connect each proposed measure to that problem, including the resources needed for the measure to function.",
      "claim_ids": [
        "CL-6137-2.2.07-1",
        "CL-6137-2.2.07-2",
