    {
      "block_id": "BL-6137-2.2.07-17",
      "block_type": "worked_application",
      "heading": "",
      "text": "Consider a hypothetical comparison over the same area and season. A new seed-and-nutrient package increases crop sales receipts by N$12,000 but adds N$9,000 in complete additional costs. The additional net return is N$3,000 under those stated figures. If the extra costs instead total N$14,000, the added harvest reduces net return by N$2,000. This partial change comparison assumes other receipts and costs are unchanged; it does not establish the farm's total profit.",
      "claim_ids": [
